# Latest Cyber Security News

<p>Aggregated news from various sources. Updated periodically when the site rebuilds.</p>

<div class="news-list">
{% if newsfeeds.length > 0 %}
    {% for item in newsfeeds %}
        <article class="news-item">
            <h3><a href="{{ item.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ item.title }}</a></h3>
            {% if item.snippet %}
            <p>{{ item.snippet }}{% if item.snippet.length >= 150 %}...{% endif %}</p>
            {% endif %}
            <p class="news-source">
                Source: {{ item.sourceTitle }} | Published: <time datetime="{{ item.pubDate | htmlDateString }}">{{ item.pubDate | readableDate }}</time>
            </p>
        </article>
    {% endfor %}
{% else %}
    <p>Could not load news items at this time.</p>
{% endif %}
</div>
```    *   The news will only update when you rebuild and redeploy your site.